## Multi-Language Test Framework Support

### TypeScript/JavaScript (Playwright, Cypress, Selenium)
```typescript
import { test, expect, Page } from '@playwright/test';

test.describe('Feature Name', () => {
    test('Scenario Description', async ({ page }) => {
        // Test implementation
    });
});
```

### Python (Pytest, Selenium, Playwright)
```python
import pytest
from playwright.sync_api import Page

def test_feature_scenario(page: Page):
    # Test implementation
    pass
```

### C# (NUnit, xUnit, SpecFlow)
```csharp
using NUnit.Framework;

[TestFixture]
public class FeatureTests
{
    [Test]
    public void ScenarioTest()
    {
        // Test implementation
    }
}
```

### Java (JUnit, TestNG, Selenium)
```java
import org.junit.jupiter.api.Test;

public class FeatureTest {
    @Test
    public void scenarioTest() {
        // Test implementation
    }
}
```

### Ruby (RSpec, Capybara)
```ruby
require 'spec_helper'

RSpec.describe 'Feature' do
  it 'scenario description' do
    # Test implementation
  end
end
```

