## Test Pattern Examples

### Basic Single-Page Test
```
test 'User can submit form':
    1. Navigate to form page
    2. Wait for page load
    3. Fill form fields
    4. Click submit button
    5. Wait for success message
    6. Verify API call was made
    7. Verify UI updated correctly
```

### Multi-User/Multi-Session Test
```
test 'Real-time synchronization between users':
    1. Create two separate test sessions/contexts
    2. Navigate both to application
    3. Wait for both to load completely
    4. User 1 performs action
    5. Wait for real-time update propagation
    6. Verify User 2 sees the change
    7. Cleanup both sessions
```

### API Validation Test
```
test 'API returns correct data':
    1. Navigate to page
    2. Trigger action that calls API
    3. Intercept/monitor API request
    4. Verify request payload
    5. Verify response status
    6. Verify response data structure
    7. Verify UI reflects response data
```

