## Console/Log Error Monitoring

```
// Monitor for console/application errors during test
errors = []

page.on('console', msg => {
    if (msg.type() === 'error') {
        errors.push(msg.text())
    }
})

// After test actions
criticalErrors = errors.filter(err => 
    err.includes('CRITICAL_PATTERN_1') ||
    err.includes('CRITICAL_PATTERN_2')
)

expect(criticalErrors).toHaveLength(0)
```

